The terminal event carries the choice's finishReason as
metadata.providerStopReason (null when the stream ended without one), so the
service decides every finish reason from the SDK's union
(apps/api/src/lib/chat/provider-stop-reasons.ts) instead of reading an
unhandled one as "stop". Remove when upstream exposes the raw reason.

